WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:15,520
I have knee pain since December. I use DMSL cream and drops with red light therapy which helped

00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:21,680
also rye frequency. Is there a supplement for joint and inflammation for this issue?

00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:30,400
I can also be, can it also be caused from detoxing? Well, I wouldn't, if you're asking if

00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:37,360
knee pain can be caused from detoxing, I would say, yeah, probably not. Is there a supplement

00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:44,960
for joint and inflammation? So your larger joints like your knee joint and your hip joint

00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:54,400
are fluid fill joints. I mean, most of your joints are fluid fill joints, but they're going to produce

00:00:54,400 --> 00:01:04,640
a fluid in that joint capsule. So there's a capsule three dimensionally around these two bones

00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:13,840
that are coming together to form a joint. And in that capsule is a fluid that is that is joint

00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:23,680
fluid and it's produced by the capsule cells. And as we age, that joint fluid decreases and we

00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:30,080
that's where our bones can rub a little bit more, be irritated when we're walking a lot or

00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:38,160
weight bearing, especially our bigger weight bearing joints. So what can help us produce more of that

00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:44,960
joint fluid because it is the joint fluid and then gas within the fluid that gives it a push.

00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:51,040
You got millions of little bubbles within that inside that joint fluid that give the cushion

00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:58,160
of that joint to protect the two bones rubbing together. So there's two things called glucosamine

00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:04,880
and condroitin that can increase joint fluid production. How it doesn't really help with your

00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:12,320
finger joints as much, but it helps with your larger joints, especially the knees, it can be really

00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:20,160
helpful. So taking glucosamine and condroitin and neither of them are contraindicative for cancer patients,

00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:28,720
that can help increase joint fluid production and millions of people have taken that to help with

00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:39,040
degenerative arthritis, which is that loss of joint fluid and some sparing of the bones. So

00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:46,240
condroitin and glucosamine, you can usually get them in products that have both of them in a product

00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:56,240
that has both of those in there.

